            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are fantastic cookies. Light and airy with the powdered suger dusting make them irresistible. You can't eat just one! I made these with my mother when I was growing up and were always a special treat. The recipe was lost in a fire and I have looked everywhere for another. You cant imagine how excited I am to have found this one."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jerseycow6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful! I've been trying to find the recipe most like my Baba's because I left mine with my brother. We don't use alcohol in ours, either. I'm allergic to alcohol, so it was very important to find a recipe that doesn't use rum or whiskey. Thank you so much for sharing this!",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-26T13:41:29.823Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "vegaspiglet"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So yummy! My grandmother made similar ones and I lost the recipe. I'm glad to have found one almost exactly like it again.",
            "datePublished": "2004-12-16T16:25:27.357Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
